#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Base resource: the `{field}` field holds each record's subtype ({kinds}). It lists and reads "
"every kind; each subtype creates, updates and deletes its own."
msgstr ""
"Recurs base: el camp `{field}` indica el subtipus de cada registre ({kinds}). Llista i consulta "
"tots els tipus; es creen, modifiquen i eliminen a cada subtipus."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Subtype of [{base}]({base}.md) (`{identity}`): it shares its ids, common fields, state machines "
"and hooks."
msgstr ""
"Subtipus de [{base}]({base}.md) (`{identity}`): comparteix-ne els identificadors, els camps "
"comuns, les màquines d'estats i els hooks."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Multi-tenant: each record belongs to the tenant in `{field}`; operations are limited to the "
"caller's tenant."
msgstr ""
"Multi-inquilí: cada registre pertany a l'inquilí del camp `{field}`; les operacions es limiten a "
"l'inquilí de qui crida."

